class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})\\)</span>、与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 不交的可数无限变量集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span> 及普通项重写系统 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>。替换集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(S=\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span> 及其在项上的延拓采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6aa7f56f36c897f4\" href=\"?note=6aa7f56f36c897f4\" title=\"56-df-substitution-application\">56-df-substitution-application</a>；一洞上下文及填洞采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fbc74eb888873878\" href=\"?note=fbc74eb888873878\" title=\"56-df-context\">56-df-context</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_R\">\\(\\to_R\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a3b60e1e9cdeef27\" href=\"?note=a3b60e1e9cdeef27\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-step\">56-df-rewrite-step</a>。本节点所有参数按各公式中的量词独立取值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\sigma\\in S\\;\\bigl((-)\\sigma\\in T^T\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\sigma\\in S\\;\\bigl((-)\\sigma\\in T^T\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}(\\Sigma,V)\\;\\forall t\\in T\\;C[t]\\in T.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}(\\Sigma,V)\\;\\forall t\\in T\\;C[t]\\in T.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall(l,r)\\in R\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in S\\;\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}(\\Sigma,V)\\;\nC[l\\sigma]\\to_R C[r\\sigma].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall(l,r)\\in R\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in S\\;\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}(\\Sigma,V)\\;\nC[l\\sigma]\\to_R C[r\\sigma].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本节点保留输入修订补记中已给出的数学断言，并依其数学内容规范名称及类型。原文件的历史重建信息仍记录在元数据中；数学含义由前两段和所列第 56 本内部依赖确定。</p>\n<p>替换延拓的结构递归、一洞位置的唯一性及位置替换分别由所列内部定义给出。最后一式以洞位置及规则实例作为一步关系的存在见证；它不额外改变规则集，也不要求规则集非空。这里记录的是当前基础接口的闭合关系，原有数学定义仍是相应定义节点。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-substitution-application","status":"resolved","id":"6aa7f56f36c897f4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-substitution-application]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-context","status":"resolved","id":"fbc74eb888873878","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-context]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-step","status":"resolved","id":"a3b60e1e9cdeef27","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-rewrite-step]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-substitution-application","status":"resolved","id":"6aa7f56f36c897f4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定签名 $\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})$、与 $F$ 不交的可数无限变量集 $V$、$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$ 及普通项重写系统 $R$。替换集 $S=\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,V)$ 及其在项上的延拓采用 [[56-df-substitution-application]]；一洞上下文及填洞采用 [[56-df-context]]；$\\to_R$ 采用 [[56-df-rewrite-step]]。本节点所有参数按各公式中的量词独立取值。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-context","status":"resolved","id":"fbc74eb888873878","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypot